{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_design_mvp", "label": "Design do Frontend MVP do Simulador de Carteira", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "# Design \u2014 Frontend MVP do Simulador de Carteira", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-09-02", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reescreve as specs da tentativa anterior porque elas foram escritas a partir do openapi.json e do PRD, n\u00e3o do c\u00f3digo: o levantamento em docs/api/backend-api.md responde 7 das 9 perguntas abertas e invalida algumas ACs."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d01_backend_congelado", "label": "D-01 \u2014 backend congelado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O frontend contorna tudo e as specs valem sozinhas, sem depender de trabalho no outro reposit\u00f3rio."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d02_escopo_mvp", "label": "D-02 \u2014 escopo do MVP em 7 features", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Funda\u00e7\u00e3o, investidores, corretoras, a\u00e7\u00f5es, carteiras, opera\u00e7\u00f5es e dashboard. A tela de investidores entra porque POST /investidores existe e s\u00f3 h\u00e1 1 registro \u2014 sem ela o app dependeria de seed externo."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d03_recorte_dashboard", "label": "D-03 \u2014 dashboard consolidado com BR e US lado a lado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A AC-023 pro\u00edbe somar moedas, ent\u00e3o os mercados aparecem lado a lado; o gr\u00e1fico \u00e9 compras \u00d7 vendas do hist\u00f3rico porque n\u00e3o existe s\u00e9rie hist\u00f3rica de cota\u00e7\u00e3o no backend."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d04_design_system_scss", "label": "D-04 \u2014 design system em SCSS + CSS custom properties", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem depend\u00eancia nova, e as regras duras do sistema (sem sombra, sem peso 800, espa\u00e7o m\u00faltiplo de 8) ficam grep\u00e1veis para o audit mec\u00e2nico."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d05_investidor_contexto", "label": "D-05 \u2014 investidor de contexto em localStorage + guard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolve o deep-link: /carteiras/7 funciona porque o investidorId vem do storage e a lista pode ser carregada e filtrada; o contexto \u00e9 revalidado na abertura."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d06_limiar_cotacao", "label": "D-06 \u2014 limiar de cota\u00e7\u00e3o defasada (BR 30 min, US 5 min)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada limiar sai do atraso da pr\u00f3pria fonte (brapi ~30 min, Twelve Data 0,3\u20132 min), ent\u00e3o o badge \u00e2mbar s\u00f3 acende quando o dado est\u00e1 pior que o normal daquela fonte."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d07_historico_global", "label": "D-07 \u2014 hist\u00f3rico de movimenta\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00f3 global", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GET /operacoes \u00e9 paginado no servidor e n\u00e3o filtra por carteira \u2014 filtrar no cliente sobre uma \u00fanica p\u00e1gina mentiria para o usu\u00e1rio. A carteira mostra s\u00f3 posi\u00e7\u00f5es."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d08_so_excluir_lancamento", "label": "D-08 \u2014 corrigir lan\u00e7amento \u00e9 s\u00f3 excluir, sem editar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O PUT n\u00e3o revalida nada e o cliente n\u00e3o consegue validar; excluir e relan\u00e7ar usa a cota\u00e7\u00e3o do momento, que \u00e9 a RN-Q04 de qualquer jeito."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d09_rota_raiz", "label": "D-09 \u2014 rota raiz \u00e9 o dashboard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes era carteiras; com o dashboard no escopo ele passa a ser a porta de entrada."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d10_erros_cvm", "label": "D-10 \u2014 exibir a message do backend nos erros da CVM", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'N\u00e3o autorizada' e 'n\u00e3o verific\u00e1vel' s\u00e3o ambos 422 e s\u00f3 diferem pelo texto, que j\u00e1 est\u00e1 escrito para humano \u2014 classificar exigiria match de string fr\u00e1gil."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_acs_invalidadas", "label": "ACs da tentativa anterior que n\u00e3o se sustentam", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## ACs da tentativa anterior que n\u00e3o se sustentam", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AC-011 (nome da empresa), AC-012 (404 vs 422), AC-019 (falha de fonte), AC-027 (detalhe da carteira), AC-038 (editar opera\u00e7\u00e3o) e ASM-002 (situacaoCadastral como texto) caem porque foram derivadas do contrato e n\u00e3o do comportamento real."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_secao1_arquitetura", "label": "Se\u00e7\u00e3o 1 \u2014 Arquitetura e pastas do frontend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 1 \u2014 Arquitetura e pastas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_sem_mappers", "label": "Sem mappers \u2014 DTOs viram models direto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 1 \u2014 Arquitetura e pastas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O que precisaria de deriva\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 vem pronto do backend (valorTotal, rentabilidadeNaoRealizada), ent\u00e3o uma camada de mapeamento seria abstra\u00e7\u00e3o vazia."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_corte_css_componente", "label": "Corte entre classe CSS e componente compartilhado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 1 \u2014 src/styles/", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O que \u00e9 s\u00f3 apar\u00eancia vira classe; o que tem comportamento ou estrutura vira componente em shared/components/. Evita 15 componentes de uma linha e mant\u00e9m o checklist do design system grep\u00e1vel."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_investidorcontextostore", "label": "InvestidorContextoStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Estado", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9 o \u00fanico estado global do app; trocar o investidor no seletor da topbar invalida os dados das facades dependentes."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_cotacaofrescor", "label": "CotacaoFrescor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 1 \u2014 Camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Concentra o c\u00e1lculo de defasagem num lugar s\u00f3, para que o limiar por mercado n\u00e3o se espalhe pelas telas."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_investidor_contexto_guard", "label": "investidor-contexto.guard.ts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Rotas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Protege s\u00f3 o que depende de investidor (cat\u00e1logos s\u00e3o globais) e, sem contexto, redireciona para /investidores \u2014 onde se escolhe ou cadastra \u2014 em vez de bater num seletor vazio."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_revalidacao_por_lista", "label": "Revalida\u00e7\u00e3o do contexto pela lista, n\u00e3o por GET /investidores/{id}", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Rotas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A busca por id n\u00e3o filtra ativo e devolve 200 para investidor j\u00e1 exclu\u00eddo, o que deixaria o app preso num contexto morto; a listagem s\u00f3 traz ativos e \u00e9 a mesma chamada que alimenta o seletor da topbar."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_deep_link_carteira", "label": "Deep-link para /carteiras/:id", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Rotas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Como n\u00e3o existe GET /carteiras/{id}, a rota carrega GET /carteiras?investidorId=X&size=100 e procura o id na lista; n\u00e3o achou \u2192 estado 'carteira n\u00e3o encontrada' com link para a lista."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_dashboard_2_mais_n", "label": "Dashboard custa 2 + N requisi\u00e7\u00f5es (carregamento progressivo)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Os dois pontos caros", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada bloco (BR, US, gr\u00e1fico) tem skeleton pr\u00f3prio; se as posi\u00e7\u00f5es de uma carteira falharem, o bloco mostra erro parcial e informa quantas carteiras entraram na conta, em vez de exibir um total incompleto como se fosse completo."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_cadastro_corretora_lento", "label": "Cadastro de corretora \u2014 POST \u00fanico e lento", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Os dois pontos caros", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O backend encadeia Receita, CVM e ViaCEP em s\u00e9rie; o bot\u00e3o vira 'consultando Receita e CVM\u2026' e trava o formul\u00e1rio, sem timeout do lado do cliente \u2014 quem decide desistir \u00e9 o backend, com 502."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_facades_sem_cache", "label": "Facades de feature recarregam a cada entrada na rota", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Estado", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem cache entre navega\u00e7\u00f5es porque o volume \u00e9 pequeno e cota\u00e7\u00e3o envelhece. Total por moeda, rentabilidade percentual e defasagem nunca s\u00e3o guardados \u2014 sempre recalculados na tela."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_reler_apos_escrita", "label": "Reler do servidor ap\u00f3s escrita", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Escrita", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Depois do 201 de compra ou venda a tela rel\u00ea as posi\u00e7\u00f5es em vez de atualizar localmente, porque o pre\u00e7o unit\u00e1rio e o pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio saem do servidor e a posi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 recalculada l\u00e1."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_modal_compra_venda", "label": "Compra e venda em modal de formul\u00e1rio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 2 \u2014 Escrita", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O select de ticker \u00e9 filtrado pelo mercado da carteira no cliente para a RN-P01 ser imposs\u00edvel de violar na interface, em vez de virar 422 depois do envio. N\u00e3o conflita com o design system: o proibido \u00e9 o modal de confirma\u00e7\u00e3o sobre a\u00e7\u00e3o revers\u00edvel, n\u00e3o o formul\u00e1rio onde a a\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 composta."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_erro_para_tela", "label": "Mapeamento de status HTTP para tratamento na tela", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Erro para tela", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "400 com fieldErrors vira erro por campo; 400 sem message usa fallback nosso (nunca texto t\u00e9cnico cru); 404 \u00e9 estado vazio, n\u00e3o card de erro; 409 marca o campo que colidiu; 422 exibe a message como veio; 502 vira card com 'Tentar de novo'."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_tres_estados_tela", "label": "Tr\u00eas estados de toda tela de dado (skeleton, vazio, erro)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Estados", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Skeleton com a dimens\u00e3o exata do conte\u00fado real, vazio com copy dizendo o que fazer ('Adicione seu primeiro ativo', n\u00e3o 'Nenhum ativo encontrado') e erro em card com borda --down."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_badge_cotacao_defasada", "label": "Badge \u00e2mbar de cota\u00e7\u00e3o defasada", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Estados", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Se todas as cota\u00e7\u00f5es estiverem defasadas, um badge \u00fanico no cabe\u00e7alho do card e as c\u00e9lulas limpas, para n\u00e3o repetir ru\u00eddo em cada linha."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_atualizacao_silenciosa_na_tela", "label": "Detectar atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o de cota\u00e7\u00e3o que n\u00e3o atualizou", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Estados", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A tela compara dataHoraCotacao antes e depois; se n\u00e3o mudou, avisa 'n\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel atualizar agora' sem tratar como erro de tela, porque o endpoint devolveu 200."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_ticker_como_rotulo", "label": "Ticker como r\u00f3tulo no lugar do nome da empresa", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Estados", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nunca exibir travess\u00e3o no lugar de um nome que nunca vai existir; valor zerado ou indispon\u00edvel, sim, vira travess\u00e3o \u2014 nunca 0,00 nem c\u00e9lula vazia."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_testes_por_ac", "label": "Cada AC vira um teste anotado @spec:AC-xxx", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Testes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A constitui\u00e7\u00e3o exige prova execut\u00e1vel para todo requisito (P-001); a sa\u00edda TAP de npm run test:tap \u00e9 lida pelo onp-spec verify. Tr\u00eas camadas: componente para exibi\u00e7\u00e3o, facade com provideHttpClientTesting para chamada ao backend, teste de rota para navega\u00e7\u00e3o e guard. Sem e2e no MVP."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_correcoes_constituicao", "label": "Corre\u00e7\u00f5es na constitui\u00e7\u00e3o (P-002 e princ\u00edpio de design)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Se\u00e7\u00e3o 3 \u2014 Corre\u00e7\u00f5es na constitui\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P-002 verifica segredos com o glob src/**/*.js num projeto TypeScript \u2014 verifica\u00e7\u00e3o morta que cai em GLOB_SEM_ARQUIVOS; passa para src/**/*.ts. E entra um princ\u00edpio novo para as regras duras do design system, que s\u00e3o do tipo que o motor checa por regex."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_asm_d01", "label": "ASM-D01 \u2014 nenhum investidor tem mais de 100 carteiras", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Suposi\u00e7\u00f5es deste design", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Suposi\u00e7\u00e3o aberta: size=100 basta para localizar uma carteira por id no cliente, dado que n\u00e3o existe GET /carteiras/{id}."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_asm_d02", "label": "ASM-D02 \u2014 opera\u00e7\u00f5es cabem na pagina\u00e7\u00e3o padr\u00e3o", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-02-frontend-mvp-design.md", "source_location": "## Suposi\u00e7\u00f5es deste design", "source_ur